# --- duties & hiring (§1.3) -------------------------------------------------------------------------
duty.dishes.name
* Dishes

duty.dishes.desc
* Clears tables, washes up and puts left tips in the jar.

duty.floor.name
* Floor

duty.floor.desc
* Mops, empties buckets and does the cleaning on the checklists.

duty.register.name
* Register

duty.register.desc
* Takes plain orders and payments. Wishes and regulars stay with you.

duty.bar.name
* Bar

duty.bar.desc
* Makes plain drinks the menu way. Your recipes stay yours.

duty.kitchen.name
* Kitchen

duty.kitchen.desc
* Makes plain food the menu way. Your recipes stay yours.

duty.serving.name
* Serving

duty.serving.desc
* Carries what helpers made. You always carry your own.

